Strategy: // CSD_RATIONALE_BEGIN
// Revised from the prior delimiter-triggered baseline with one minimal
// verification-oriented fix while preserving the strategy shape.
//
// The previous version could legally return with maxSteps > 0 and no observable
// state change when it broke immediately on EOS or on the constrained hard cap
// before any step had been counted. That is exactly the remaining failed
// postcondition. The fix is therefore small and local: strengthen the loop
// invariant with a "no-change implies zero steps" fact,
//   steps == 0 ==> generated == generatedPrefix &&
//                 insideConstrainedOut == insideConstrained &&
//                 currentConstrainedOut == currentConstrained
// and preserve it by noting that every non-breaking branch increments steps
// after any state change, while every breaking branch either occurs after
// steps > 0 has already been established or leaves the initial state untouched.
// This gives Dafny the missing bridge from cost == steps to the required final
